PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Discrete State
    - Node v with outgoing edges
  L2: Scaffolding Arrow
    - Large arrow labeled "𝒢"
    - 8px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L3: Geometric Reconstruction
    - Manifold patch with embedded point ι(v)
    - Local tangent frame drawn
  L4: Labels
    - "Geometric Scaffolding Operator"
    - "𝒢(v)"
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "Discrete → Local Geometry"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
